WEBVTT

NOTE Translated from the film’s existing French on-screen captions.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Creating a custom website or tool often means months of waiting and real technical complexity.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.500
But developer Antony Addy changes the picture completely. Here's how.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.000
First: dramatically shorter timelines.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Forget endless schedules. A finished project now takes four days on average.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.500
The result: your product reaches the market almost immediately.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Next: the method behind that speed.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.500
Artificial intelligence is more than a gimmick for creating a buzz. It's a real creative workshop,

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.500
guided by an expert developer and trainer.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.000
And finally: the proof is in the work.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.500
His portfolio showcases over twenty real products, already online and bilingual.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.000
These creations span four different types of project,

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.000
without ever compromising on the finishing touches.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.500
In short, entrusting your project to an expert who understands AI

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.000
means a custom result, ready to use in record time.
